    "body": "This PR updates the payment request flow to handle mints that do not support the `bolt11` payment method. \n\n**Changes:**\n- `MintLimitChecker` now returns `isValid = true` but sets a new flag `isBolt11Supported = false` when the mint lacks `bolt11` support, instead of failing the limit check with `DISABLED`.\n- `PaymentRequestActivity` checks the active lightning mint for `bolt11` support. If it's unsupported, it skips the `startLightningMintFlow()` and hides the Unified and Lightning tabs, forcing the Cashu tab to be selected.\n- Updated `MintLimitCheckerTest` to match the new behavior.\n",
